Overview
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This page describes how to evaluate the :adi:`{{ processor }}`
with the {{ som | upper }} system-on-module (SoM) on the {{ carrier | upper }}
carrier board. The SoM carries the processor, its memories and power supplies;
the carrier board provides the peripherals and the on-board debug agent.

